  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia comes to Tom's house. She has a big blue bag. \"What is in the bag?\" asks Tom. Mia opens it. She has a helicopter and a ship. She has a red truck, too. \"Wow!\" says Tom. \"Can we play?\" asks Mia. \"Yes, please!\" says Tom. They sit on the floor.",
      "Tom takes the helicopter. \"I like this toy!\" says Tom. \"I want the helicopter,\" says Mia. Tom does not give it. Mia is sad. Pip comes with a toy monster. The monster is green and ugly. \"Woof!\" says Pip. He puts it next to Mia. Tom looks at Mia.",
      "\"Why is Mia sad?\" thinks Tom. \"Sorry, Mia,\" says Tom. \"Here you are.\" He gives her the helicopter. \"Thank you!\" says Mia. \"You can have the truck.\" Tom plays with the red truck. Mia plays with the helicopter. The ship and the monster play, too. Pip jumps and jumps. Now they are all happy."
    ],
